Spec: Actual owned FRP platform bridge verification

Purpose:
  Exercise the source-built backend and frpc binaries through protected Windows Agent pipes with nonexportable device identities.

Owns:
  ./verify.ps1
  ./README.md

Structure:
  ./dotnet: Isolated Agent-owned runtime composition and actual relay traffic.

References:
  /backend-frp/backend-frp.sdd
  /windows/LinkGate.Runtime/LinkGate.Runtime.sdd

Must:
  Hold source-built binaries in verified owned Jobs, sign only public client CSRs and keep client keys nonexportable.
  Reject unrelated pipe clients before external delivery, verify actual relay bytes and server revocation, and preserve unrelated approved runtime ownership.
  Treat transport fixture bytes separately from Agent end-to-end data mTLS, SDK integration or physical NAT acceptance.
